# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:17C5"
msgid "Goodbye, stranger."
msgstr "再見，陌生人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "This is boring, I will not wait upon your slow wit. "
msgstr "真無聊，我可不等你這個慢半拍的傢伙。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "Well, Dungbreath, I cannot wait here forever."
msgstr "喂，臭糞之息，我可不能在這裡一直等下去。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "I find you irritating. Go now, Dungbreath, and do not return."
msgstr "我覺得你很煩。現在就走，臭糞之息，別再回來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "I will not kill you yet, fool. But if you ever speak to me again, you will risk death. "
msgstr "我還不會殺你，蠢貨。但你要是再跟我說話，就是在拿命冒險。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "Perhaps your thoughts are too much for your little mind. Think less, Dungbreath, it will serve you well."
msgstr "也許你那點小腦袋裝不下你的想法。少想一點吧，臭糞之息，這對你有好處。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
msgid "If you wish to speak, you must first open your mouth, dullard. "
msgstr "想說話就得先張開嘴，笨蛋。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:1A41"
