# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I meant no offense. "
msgstr "我沒有冒犯的意思。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Must you be so obstinate? "
msgstr "你非得這麼固執嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You will tell me what I want to know! "
msgstr "你非告訴我我想知道的事不可！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I will crush you! "
msgstr "我要把你捏碎！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You would not understand. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Nevermind. "
msgstr "算了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I meant no offense. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1C1E"
msgid "Some was taken, but I am a forgiving sort. What do you want of me? "
msgstr "是有點冒犯到我，不過我這人很大度。你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Must you be so obstinate? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1C98"
msgid "Only to those of a churlish nature. "
msgstr "只對粗魯的人這樣。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You will tell me what I want to know! "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1D04"
msgid "Leave... here... now. Else die. "
msgstr "離開……這裡……現在。不然就死。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You are not worthy to live! "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You are not worthy to live! "
msgstr "你不配活著！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You are not worthy to live! "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1DAA"
msgid "You are wrong, it is you who are not worthy, and I shall prove it upon your body, knave! "
msgstr "你錯了，不配的是你，我會在你身上證明這一點，無賴！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1F16"
msgid "Do you know what you have done? You have allowed Bane to destroy one of the most powerful, resourceful, and courageous Sorcerers this isle has ever known. I shall never forgive you for it, even though Malchir has. Leave me be. "
msgstr "你知道你做了什麼嗎？你讓貝恩毀了這座島上前所未有、最強大、最機智、最勇敢的巫師。就算馬爾奇爾原諒了你，我也永遠不會原諒你。別來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:1F91"
msgid "Go! You have killed my closest comrade! What else would you have of me? Leave me alone! "
msgstr "走！你殺了我最親密的同伴！你還想從我這裡得到什麼？別來煩我！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2021"
msgid "If you speak to me again, I shall allow you to feel the agony that you visited upon my friend! Leave or die! "
msgstr "你要是再跟我說話，我就讓你嘗嘗你加諸在我朋友身上的痛苦！走，不然就死！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2102"
msgid "Now that Vardion has allowed you to join us, you should learn as much from him as you can. Vardion always says that a moment spent in study is worth a day spent at play. "
msgstr "既然瓦爾迪恩讓你加入我們了，你就該盡量跟他學。瓦爾迪恩總說，用功片刻勝過玩樂一整天。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:21A8"
msgid "I thank you for helping to destroy that conniving kith, Bane. She would have driven the Sorcerers into open war with the Tenebraens. "
msgstr "謝謝你幫忙除掉貝恩那隻工於心計的奇斯怪蛛。她原本會讓巫師們跟泰尼伯瑞人公開開戰。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2239"
msgid "Prepare for the Trials of the Obsidian Fortress as best as you can. You are not allowed to leave once you have entered. "
msgstr "盡你所能準備黑曜石要塞試煉吧。一旦進去，就不准出來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:22B2"
msgid "Forgive me, for I can speak no more at the moment, matters weigh heavily upon my mind... Farewell. "
msgstr "原諒我，我現在沒辦法多說，有事壓在我心頭……再會。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:23AA"
msgid "Master! I am not worthy. Forgive my lack of attentiveness. I will return to my studies. There is no need for punishment. I promise that my performance will improve. You'll see. "
msgstr "大師！我不配。原諒我的疏忽。我會回去研習的。不必懲罰我。我保證我的表現會進步。您會看到的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2453"
msgid "Forgive me. I have offended you. I never seem to do things right. I will redouble my efforts to make your faith in me not seem misplaced. "
msgstr "原諒我。我冒犯了您。我好像總是做不好事情。我會加倍努力，不讓您對我的信任落空。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What can you tell me of this place? "
msgstr "關於這個地方，你能告訴我什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What do you do here? "
msgstr "你在這裡做什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nevermind. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Farewell. "
msgstr "再會。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Farewell. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:25FE"
msgid "Is there anything else, {varF8}?"
msgstr "還有別的事嗎，{varF8}？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you tell me of this place? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:275B"
msgid "Well, {varF8}, this is the Sorcerer's Enclave."
msgstr "嗯，{varF8}，這裡是巫師聚落。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you tell me of this place? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Tell me about Sorcerer's Enclave. "
msgstr "說說巫師聚落。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you tell me of this place? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What can you say of Sorcerers? "
msgstr "關於巫師，你能說些什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What do you do here? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2815"
msgid "I am a Sorcerer. "
msgstr "我是巫師。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
msgstr "別叫我臭糞之息。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:28D0"
msgid "Tell me your name, and I won't. "
msgstr "告訴我你的名字，我就不叫。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I am called, {name}."
msgstr "我叫{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Why must you know? "
msgstr "你為什麼非知道不可？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Don't call me Dungbreath. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I will not tell you. "
msgstr "我不告訴你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I will not tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2996"
msgid "That's much better. Now we can be on speaking terms. "
msgstr "這樣好多了。現在我們可以好好說話了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why must you know? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2A37"
msgid "I don't, I just will continue to call you Dungbreath until I know a name to call you. "
msgstr "我不是非知道不可，只是在知道怎麼叫你之前，我會一直叫你臭糞之息。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why must you know? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Fine then, call me, {name}."
msgstr "好吧，那就叫我{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why must you know? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You will never know. "
msgstr "你永遠別想知道。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You will never know. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2AED"
msgid "That's much better. Now we can be on speaking terms. "
msgstr "這樣好多了。現在我們可以好好說話了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You will never know. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2B4C"
msgid "Fine, Dungbreath. "
msgstr "好啊，臭糞之息。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I will not tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2BBB"
msgid "Fine, Dungbreath. "
msgstr "好啊，臭糞之息。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerer's Enclave. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:2CAA"
msgid "Let me see, {varF8}. It's in a ravine. It's filled with lava. Hmmm... Yes, that's about it."
msgstr "我想想，{varF8}。它在一道峽谷裡。裡面滿是熔岩。嗯……對，大概就這樣。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerer's Enclave. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You're not very bright, are you? "
msgstr "你不太聰明，對吧？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerer's Enclave. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I see. That was helpful. "
msgstr "我懂了。真是幫了大忙。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerer's Enclave. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What an... esoteric description. "
msgstr "好一個……深奧的描述。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you say of Sorcerers? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2DD7"
msgid "Oh, quite a bit. I am most knowledgeable, you know. I have studied here for a long time. Since I was a babe. "
msgstr "噢，可多了。你知道，我可是很博學的。我在這裡學了很久，從還是個嬰兒時就開始了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you say of Sorcerers? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Well... What can you say? "
msgstr "那……你能說些什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you say of Sorcerers? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You were born here? "
msgstr "你是在這裡出生的？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What can you say of Sorcerers? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I find that hard to believe. "
msgstr "我很難相信。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Not really very bright, are you? "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Not really very bright, are you? "
msgstr "你真的不太聰明，對吧？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Not really very bright, are you? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2EB2"
msgid "Smart enough not to speak to someone who insults me! "
msgstr "聰明到不跟侮辱我的人說話！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I see. That was helpful. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:2FAF"
msgid "Thank you. Glad to be of aid. Vardion always says that I am so mercifully free of cluttering thoughts. I'm not sure what he means, but he smiles when he says it. So it must be good. "
msgstr "謝謝。很高興能幫上忙。瓦爾迪恩總說我「幸好沒有雜亂的念頭」。我不太懂他的意思，不過他說的時候都在笑，所以一定是好話。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I see. That was helpful. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Vardion? Tell me of him. "
msgstr "瓦爾迪恩？說說他。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I see. That was helpful. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "You -are- free of thought. "
msgstr "你「確實」什麼念頭都沒有。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I see. That was helpful. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I think he means you are stupid. "
msgstr "我想他是說你很笨。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I see. That was helpful. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "It is good to have friends. "
msgstr "有朋友真好。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What an... esoteric description. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3114"
msgid "Do you think so? What's esso?... Bane uses that word sometimes. She's not nice like Vardion. What do you mean? "
msgstr "你這麼覺得嗎？什麼是深……？貝恩有時會用這個詞。她不像瓦爾迪恩那麼好。你是什麼意思？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What an... esoteric description. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Nothing. Don't worry about it. "
msgstr "沒什麼。別在意。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What an... esoteric description. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgstr "告訴我你對貝恩知道些什麼。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Well... What can you say? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:31E7"
msgid "Hmmm? About what, {varF8}?"
msgstr "嗯？關於什麼，{varF8}？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You were born here? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:32E4"
msgid "Of course. Are you a simpleton? All Pagans are born on this island. Not very smart, are you? "
msgstr "當然。你是笨蛋嗎？所有佩根人都是在這座島上出生的。你不太聰明，對吧？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I find that hard to believe. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:33A2"
msgid "No, really. I was a child at one time. "
msgstr "不，真的。我以前也當過小孩。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Vardion? Tell me of him. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:34D0"
msgid "He is the greatest Pagan alive. Um, except for the Master, perhaps. He knows so many things. It hurts my head to even think about what he knows. "
msgstr "他是世上最偉大的佩根人。呃，也許除了大師以外。他知道好多事情。光是想他知道的那些事，我的頭就痛。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Vardion? Tell me of him. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Why is he so great? "
msgstr "他為什麼這麼偉大？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Vardion? Tell me of him. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Can you tell me what he knows? "
msgstr "你能告訴我他知道些什麼嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Vardion? Tell me of him. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Who is the Master. "
msgstr "大師是誰？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "About Sorcerer's Enclave! "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "About Sorcerer's Enclave! "
msgstr "關於巫師聚落！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "About Sorcerer's Enclave! "
msgctxt "bark 041F:35AD"
msgid "I can tell you this... You are beginning to anger me! "
msgstr "我可以告訴你……你開始惹我生氣了！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3621"
msgid "Why, is she a friend of yours? "
msgstr "怎麼，她是你的朋友嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "As a matter of fact, yes. "
msgstr "事實上，是的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "No, of course not. "
msgstr "不，當然不是。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Why do you ask? "
msgstr "你為什麼這麼問？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:36E3"
msgid "I have already told you. She is a back-stabbing, foul-tempered, mean-spirited wench. "
msgstr "我已經跟你說過了。她是個背後捅刀、脾氣暴躁、心腸惡毒的女人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3745"
msgid "Vardion has plans for her. "
msgstr "瓦爾迪恩對她另有打算。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me what you know of Bane. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Tell me his plans. "
msgstr "告訴我他的打算。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I think he means you are stupid. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:37FB"
msgid "And I think you are a dolt! "
msgstr "我看你才是蠢材！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "It is good to have friends. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3872"
msgid "Yes, and Vardion is the best friend to have. "
msgstr "是啊，而瓦爾迪恩是最好的朋友。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You -are- free of thought. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:390E"
msgid "Thank you. But you are not very original, {varF8}."
msgstr "謝謝。不過你也沒什麼新意，{varF8}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Nothing. Don't worry about it. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3993"
msgid "I won't. "
msgstr "我不會在意的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "No. Your knowledge is suspect. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "No. Your knowledge is suspect. "
msgstr "不。你的知識很可疑。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "No. Your knowledge is suspect. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3A16"
msgid "A suspect of what? "
msgstr "是什麼的嫌疑犯？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "No. Your knowledge is suspect. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Do you know anything of value? "
msgstr "你知道什麼有價值的事嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "No. Your knowledge is suspect. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "That's it. I've had it. Goodbye! "
msgstr "夠了。我受夠了。再見！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I meant, here in the Enclave. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "I meant, here in the Enclave. "
msgstr "我是說，在這個聚落裡出生。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I meant, here in the Enclave. "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:3B45"
msgid "Oh, yes. I was born in this room. {varF8} I don't remember anything about it though. So don't ask."
msgstr "噢，是啊。我就是在這個房間出生的。{varF8}不過那時的事我什麼都不記得了，所以別問。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why is he so great? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3BF5"
msgid "Because he is the First Acolyte, and... because he said so. "
msgstr "因為他是第一學徒，而且……因為他自己這麼說。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why is he so great? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What is a First Acolyte? "
msgstr "第一學徒是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why is he so great? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Acolyte? What is that? "
msgstr "學徒？那是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why is he so great? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Do you believe everything he says? "
msgstr "他說什麼你都信？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Can you tell me what he knows? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3CFB"
msgid "No! I told you it hurts to even think about it. You must be deaf. "
msgstr "不能！我跟你說了，光想就頭痛。你一定是聾了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who is the Master. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3D8E"
msgid "Master Malchir is the leader of the Sorcerers. "
msgstr "馬爾奇爾大巫師是巫師們的領袖。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who is the Master. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "Tell me about Master Malchir. "
msgstr "說說馬爾奇爾大巫師。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who is the Master. "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "How did Malchir become leader? "
msgstr "馬爾奇爾是怎麼成為領袖的？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "As a matter of fact, yes. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3EB3"
msgid "Well, guard your back well. You would be suprised what might sprout from it, with her as your 'friend'. "
msgstr "那你可要小心你的背後。有她這種「朋友」，你背上長出什麼東西來，可別太驚訝。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "No, of course not. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:3F5A"
msgid "Well, you should know that Vardion has some plans concerning her. "
msgstr "那你應該知道，瓦爾迪恩對她另有打算。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Why do you ask? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:40A0"
msgid "Because she is a back-stabbing, foul-tempered, mean-spirited wench. And she hates me. I don't know why, but now I hate her too. Again, is she your friend? "
msgstr "因為她是個背後捅刀、脾氣暴躁、心腸惡毒的女人。而且她討厭我。我不知道為什麼，但現在我也討厭她了。我再問一次，她是你的朋友嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Do you know anything of value? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:41BA"
msgid "I know that you are beginning to irritate me. And that I don't have to listen to you. Leave me be. "
msgstr "我知道你開始惹我心煩了，也知道我不必聽你的。別來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me his plans. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:422E"
msgid "No, I can't do that. You have to ask him yourself. "
msgstr "不，我不能說。你得自己去問他。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Master Malchir. "
msgctxt "bark 041F:4315"
msgid "Why should I? You aren't a Sorcerer. And if you want to be one, you should talk to Vardion. I don't have the patience to train you. "
msgstr "我為什麼要說？你又不是巫師。如果你想當巫師，就該去找瓦爾迪恩。我可沒耐心訓練你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "How did Malchir become leader? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:44AC"
msgid "How should I know? He was Master when I started learning to walk. In my first memories, I remember hearing him say that I would be a strong Acolyte one day. This seemed to bring him great pleasure. "
msgstr "我怎麼會知道？我開始學走路時，他就已經是大師了。在我最早的記憶裡，我記得聽到他說我有一天會成為強大的學徒。這似乎讓他非常高興。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is a First Acolyte? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:45AD"
msgid "That is the Sorcerer who runs the Enclave in the Master's absence. Really, that's just about all the time. "
msgstr "就是大師不在時管理聚落的巫師。說真的，大師幾乎一直都不在。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Acolyte? What is that? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:464E"
msgid "You're looking at one. "
msgstr "你眼前就是一個。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Acolyte? What is that? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What does being an Acolyte entail? "
msgstr "當學徒要做什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Do you believe everything he says? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:471D"
msgid "Yes. He has never lied to me yet. He told me so. "
msgstr "是的。他從來沒騙過我。是他自己告訴我的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What does being an Acolyte entail? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041F:47FB"
msgid "We assist the Master with his rituals, {varF8}. He draws upon our power to replace his when it wanes."
msgstr "我們協助大師舉行儀式，{varF8}。他的力量衰退時，就汲取我們的力量來補充。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What does being an Acolyte entail? "
msgctxt "ask 041F"
msgid "What rituals? "
msgstr "什麼儀式？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What rituals? "
msgctxt "bark 041F:48BC"
msgid "I can't tell you. You are not a Sorcerer. "
msgstr "我不能告訴你。你又不是巫師。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after ""
msgctxt "bark 041F:49A6"
msgid "I can't understand you. What did you say? "
msgstr "我聽不懂。你說什麼？"

